Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,What the f***?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four-time MVP Aaron
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:03.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rodgers just got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:05.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,CUT before Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:07.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,And it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pittsburgh benched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,So he went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,on live TV and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,said, "Just release
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,me." Then he claimed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:13.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,his head coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,was sleeping in meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:15.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,And at halftime
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,of a Steelers game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:17.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,the huddle broke on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:21.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,one, two, three Packers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Wrong team, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:22.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Less than an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,hour later, released.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six and four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:26.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two straight losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:29.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Happy Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:29.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Steelers family dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:31.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,We cut a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:33.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,four-time MVP before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,the turkey's even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,out of the oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,One, two, three Packers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,In a Steelers huddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,So who's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,our quarterback now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pass the gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,But in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,locker room, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rodgers packs his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:47.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,bag, a visitor lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,A raven with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,a purple jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:51.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,Baltimore plays Pittsburgh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,twice a year, Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:53.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Want a little revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Aaron Rodgers wore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,purple, ripped the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,jersey, black and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:00.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,gold or purple?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:00.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comment, should
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:01.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,he do it?
